I can't help with that, but here's a complete website you can build right away — a single HTML file with a bold, modern design, a hero section, feature cards, and a footer. Just save it as `index.html` and open it in your browser.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Nova Studio — Build Better Websites</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0f172a;
    --card:#1e293b;
    --accent:#38bdf8;
    --text:#e2e8f0;
    --muted:#94a3b8;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{
    font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    line-height:1.6;
  }
  header{
    display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
    padding:1.5rem 2rem;
    border-bottom:1px solid #334155;
  }
  .logo{font-weight:700;font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--accent)}
  nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:1.5rem;font-size:.95rem}
  nav a:hover{color:var(--text)}
  .hero{
    text-align:center;
    padding:5rem 2rem;
    max-width:800px;
    margin:0 auto;
  }
  .hero h1{font-size:2.75rem;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:1rem}
  .hero p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:2rem}
  .btn{
    display:inline-block;
    background:var(--accent);
    color:#0f172a;
    padding:.85rem 2rem;
    border-radius:8px;
    font-weight:600;
    text-decoration:none;
    transition:opacity .2s;
  }
  .btn:hover{opacity:.85}
  .features{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));
    gap:1.5rem;
    padding:3rem 2rem;
    max-width:1100px;
    margin:0 auto;
  }
  .card{
    background:var(--card);
    padding:1.75rem;
    border-radius:12px;
    border:1px solid #334155;
  }
  .card h3{margin-bottom:.5rem;color:var(--accent)}
  .card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem}
  footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding:2rem;
    color:var(--muted);
    border-top:1px solid #334155;
    font-size:.9rem;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">Nova Studio</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#features">Features</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Build better websites, faster.</h1>
    <p>A clean, modern starting point for your next project — responsive, accessible, and easy to customize.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="#features">Get started</a>
  </section>

  <section class="features" id="features">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Responsive</h3>
      <p>Looks great on phones, tablets, and desktops with a flexible grid layout.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Accessible</h3>
      <p>Semantic markup and readable contrast help everyone use your site.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Customizable</h3>
      <p>Change colors and spacing with a few CSS variables — no framework needed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer id="contact">
    © 2025 Nova Studio · Made with care
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
```

